{% comment %}
  SLAP Supply Mockup How It Works Section
{% endcomment %}

<section class="slap-mockup-how">
  <div class="slap-mockup-how__container">
    <div class="slap-mockup-how__header">
      <p>—— STATION 03 — PROCESS</p>
      <h2>HOW IT WORKS</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="slap-mockup-how__steps">
      <div class="slap-mockup-how__step">
        <div class="slap-mockup-how__step-number">01</div>
        <h3>UPLOAD YOUR DESIGN</h3>
        <p>Or use our free design tool to create something fresh.<br>
        <em>(we accept pretty much any file format)</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="slap-mockup-how__step">
        <div class="slap-mockup-how__step-number">02</div>
        <h3>CHOOSE YOUR SPECS</h3>
        <p>Size, shape, material, finish — you're in control.<br>
        <em>(we'll send you a proof before we print)</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="slap-mockup-how__step">
        <div class="slap-mockup-how__step-number">03</div>
        <h3>WE PRINT & SHIP</h3>
        <p>3-day turnaround, shipped fast, arrives ready to slap.<br>
        <em>(seriously, we're fast)</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="slap-mockup-how__step">
        <div class="slap-mockup-how__step-number">04</div>
        <h3>SLAP EVERYWHERE</h3>
        <p>Laptops, water bottles, storefronts, the moon — wherever.<br>
        <em>(please don't actually slap the moon)</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mockup How It Works",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mockup How It Works"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
